            },
            "createdOn": 1771826667,
            "author": {
                "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                "username": "harshit-aghera"
            },
            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 11,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Why is an individual sensor producer doing this?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 11,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "We want PlatformEnvironmentMetrics metric report that contains all the thermal, power, and energy sensors from this app to be always present on redfish."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 11,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Note \"Platform\" in PlatformEnvironmentMetrics, that is a platform level decision.  You don't get to implement that in a single sensor, and probably not by default.\n\nIf that's the result you want, it's a trivial command to Redfish to go create a metric report with all the sensors.  the sensor itself should not be requesting it."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Overall it's not clear it's a single sensors job to create a collection of sensors in telemetry service?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "Each individual sensor call into `SensorMetricReport` class's api to register itself for the metric report and then `SensorMetricReport` class will call into Telemetry Sevices DBus APIs to add all the registered sensors to metric report."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaGpuEnergySensor.hpp",
                    "line": 24,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Don't forward declare classes."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaGpuEnergySensor.hpp",
                    "line": 24,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "Removed."
                }
            ],
